      "statement": "All configuration comes from environment variables parsed and validated with zod in src/config.ts at import time; validation fails fast (process.exit(1)) on invalid PORT, missing DOCS_ROOT/PARTIALS_ROOT/EXAMPLES_ROOT, or a missing API key for the selected provider.",
