      "id": "claim_d89d42ee66e14c89a57745fff07c99f5",
      "statement": "Embedding API failures during store.build retry up to 3 times with exponential backoff on HTTP 429/5xx and throw immediately on other statuses; a failure propagates to main() and process.exit(1), so a cold start that cannot reach the embeddings API fails loudly rather than serving an empty index.",
