    {
      "id": "claim_4361f6c4a0074b6ba0dbecc915303dc2",
      "statement": "Per-request server failures are isolated: if mcpServer.connect or transport.handleRequest throws, httpTransport.ts logs the error and responds 500 if no headers were sent yet; the per-request server model means one failed request cannot poison the next because each starts from a fresh McpServer.",
